    "title": "CPI Report Today: What to Expect From August Inflation Data and FED Decision",
    "summary": "The post CPI Report Today: What to Expect From August Inflation Data and FED Decision appeared first on Coinpedia Fintech News\nThe August U.S. Consumer Price Index (CPI) report is due today at 8:30 a.m. ET, with markets watching the data for clues about the Federal Reserve’s next policy decision. The report comes after the Producer Price Index (PPI) rose 5.4% year over year, above the 5.3% market forecast, pushing Treasury yields higher and putting pressure …",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://coinpedia.org/news/cpi-report-today-what-to-expect-from-august-inflation-data-and-fed-decision/",
    "source": "Coinpedia",
    "tags": [
      "Federal Reserve",
      "United States"
    ],
    "origin": "rss",
    "pubDate": "2026-09-11T06:29:59.000Z",
    "fetchedAt": "2026-09-11T07:41:11.530Z",
    "isDuplicateOf": null,
    "content": "The U.S. Consumer Price Index (CPI) report for August is released today, capturing market attention ahead of the Federal Reserve's upcoming policy decision. This crucial inflation data follows a higher-than-expected Producer Price Index (PPI) report, which previously pushed Treasury yields higher and created market pressure as investors look for economic clues.",
    "content_ta": "ஆகஸ்ட் மாதத்துக்கான U.S. Consumer Price Index (CPI) அறிக்கை இன்று வெளியாகி உள்ளது. இது Federal Reserve-ன் அடுத்த வட்டி விகித முடிவு குறித்த எதிர்பார்ப்பை ஏற்படுத்தியுள்ளது. முந்தைய Producer Price Index (PPI) தரவுகள் எதிர்பார்த்ததை விட அதிகமாக இருந்ததால், Treasury yields அதிகரித்து சந்தையில் முதலீட்டாளர்களின் கவனம் இந்த புள்ளிவிவரங்கள் மீது திரும்பியுள்ளது.",
    "slug": "cpi-report-today-what-to-expect-from-august-inflation-data-and-fed-decision"
